  "text": "## Common Mistakes (Don't Make These!)  \n❌ **Mistake 1:** Ignoring customer data access request\n✅ **Correct:** Forward to DPO within 24 hours  \n❌ **Mistake 2:** Sharing customer data with third party without consent\n✅ **Correct:** Only share with explicit permission or legal requirement  \n❌ **Mistake 3:** Keeping customer data longer than necessary\n✅ **Correct:** Delete/archive when retention period expires  \n❌ **Mistake 4:** Discussing customer data in public (overhearing customers)\n✅ **Correct:** Have sensitive conversations in private area  \n---",
